<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43357" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαίσθ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθάνομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with quick senses</i> or <i>keen perceptions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					812b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφας εὐ. ζῷον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					630b21
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				75c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς καρδίας τὴν ὑπερῴαν -οτέραν
					ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.14d
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἄνθρωπος -ότατος τῶν ἄλλων ζῴων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					660a20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαισθησία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.387
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἔχειν τινός</span> have <i>keen
				perceptions</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				670b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				661b
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οτέρως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἔχειν περὶ ὥρας καὶ μηνῶν καὶ
					ἐνιαυτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					527d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>easy to perceive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				289a7
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.956f
			</span></i>.</div>
